  "zh": {
    "text": {
      "zh": "经授权转载苦力怕论坛用户「淀粉面」仿鲁迅笔法写的《论茶馆》：借茶馆里的看客，讽刺所谓「MCBBS 复活」只剩空口号的「原班人马」，以及国内 MC 社区一贯的分家内斗。作者随后写下自己的看法：新论坛挂着「开放包容」的匾，里面供的还是当年等级森严的那一套，十年攒下的攻略帖、技术帖却早已散失。这场复兴是涅槃还是借尸还魂，值得警惕。"
    },
    "source": {
      "chars": 978,
      "minhash": ""
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "text": {
      "en": "Reprints, with permission, “On the Teahouse” by KLPBBS user 淀粉面, a satire in the style of Lu Xun aimed at the “MCBBS revival”: an old guard selling slogans with nothing behind them, and a Chinese Minecraft community that keeps splitting into feuding camps. The author adds a commentary: the new forum hangs an “open and inclusive” sign over the same rigid hierarchy, while a decade of guides and technical posts has already been lost. Rebirth, or a corpse dressed up? The author is wary."
    },
    "source": {
      "chars": 3859,
